<div class="col-100">
<h2 id="tracking" class="doc-h2">Project tracking</h2>
<p class="doc-body">Parent project <a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=5">#5 Schema</a>. This plan is <a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=289">#289 SCHEMAPG</a>. Named sub-projects (not “Phase N”). GATE = done-when.</p>
<table class="doc-table">
    <thead><tr><th class="doc-th">Sub-project</th><th class="doc-th">Todo</th><th class="doc-th">Gate</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=290">#290 SCPG-EVAL</a></td>
            <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2323">#2323</a> role eval · <a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2324">#2324</a> dep check</td>
