            <td class="doc-td"><a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2325">#2325</a> allowlist · <a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2326">#2326</a> named get_connection · <a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2343">#2343</a> from_context (HASH-ref crash)</td>
            <td class="doc-td"><strong>Met.</strong> Named PG secret connects (or returns a real Pg error). Never Invalid db_type. Callers use <code>from_context</code>.</td>
